      <Desc>IN 2024 SDCKT CONTINUED TO TEACH BOATING AND SMALL CRAFT SAFETY TO SAN DIEGO AREAYOUTH THROUGH OUR INTRO TO PADDLING, SUMMER CAMPS AND PARTNERSHIPS WITH HOMESCHOOL GROUPS, WITH A TRANSITION TO A NEW PROGRAM STRUCTURE WITH PADDLE ACADEMY IN THE FALL. WE WERE ONCE AGAIN RECIPIENTS OF A GRANT FROM THE CALIFORNIA DIVISION OF BOATING AND WATERWAYS WHICH ENABLED US TO PURCHASE ADDITIONAL SAFETY EQUIPMENT. ONE OF OUR MEMBERS STARTED A PROGRAM TO REBURBISH MANY OF OUR CLUB BOATS AND TEACH BOAT MAINTAINANCE TO OUR MEMBERS. OUR ATHLETES COMPETED IN LOCAL SURFSKI WINTER RACES AND SOMEATHLETES ATTENDED NATIONAL TEAM TRIALS AND NATIONAL CHAMPIONSHIPS WITH MANY OF OUR TEAM MEMBERS RACING IN INTERNATIONAL COMPETITIONS AND PAN AMERICAN GAMES FOR THE USA NATIONAL TEAM. WE ALSO HAD A PARACANOE ATHLETE COMPETE AT PARACANOE CHAMPIONSHIPS IN HUNGARY PLUS AN ATHLETE WIN A SILVER MEDAL AT THE PARIS OLYMPICS. WE SUPPORTED ORGANIZATIONS LIKE THE CHALLENGED ATHLETE FOUNDATION BY HOSTING CLINICS AND PROVIDING SAFETY CRAFT.</Desc>
